    "product": {
      "id": 807909,
      "name": "Deck Family Farm's Fall Farm-to-Table Celebration",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Join us for a festive evening at Deck Family Farm's Fall Farm-to-Table Celebration on November 8th from 4:30 - 7:30 pm. Enjoy a six-course meal featuring beer and sausage tasting, cheese and wine pairing, and a mouthwatering Smoked Pork Shoulder with Braised Red Cabbage and Apples dinner, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients from our farm.</span><br><br><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The evening's entertainment will include live music, line dancing, farm tours, games, arts and crafts activities for kids, and more. There's something for everyone to enjoy!</span><br><br><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tickets cost $75 for adults and children 13 and older. Children 12 and under get in free with the purchase of an adult ticket.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Date and Time: November 8th, from 4:30 pm to 7:30 pm</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Location: Deck Family Farm</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">25362 High Pass Road</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Junction City, OR 97448</span></p>",
